WEBVTT

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:18.420
The smallest engine, 5 meters speed.

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:35.770
It's a strange ship.

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:39.390
I saw it in Somov's atlas.

00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:52.640
Somov, I see.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:55.790
There's a swan there.

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.840
Sergey, they're waiting for you at the 3rd station.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:05.700
All of you, are you ready? Make sure the ship is destroyed, work in weightlessness.

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:06.500
Good luck.

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:11.670
Forty meters.

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:01.840
dust

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:19.810
the light did not interfere

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:51.410
the driver went to heaven

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:15.240
Unconditionally.

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:46.520
to the

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:03.250
Thank you.

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:49.160
The existence of the Cosmic Stable Laboratory and the presence of several stages of cloning at the age of about 5 to 17-18 years allows us, without a doubt, to claim that all these individuals were taken out in vitro.

00:06:49.980 --> 00:06:57.080
Therefore, we considered it necessary to assemble this extended meeting of the Council of Contacts here on Earth's orbit.

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.960
So, this is...

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:05.630
Why were they taken out on a spaceship?

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:07.500
Is it related to weightlessness?

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:08.950
I doubt it.

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:11.670
But there is no contact.

00:07:12.190 --> 00:07:14.360
This is too categorical.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:17.470
In fact, we are dealing with a humanoid,

00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:19.400
undoubtedly intelligent creature.

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:23.160
If we create the best conditions,

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:25.320
we can hope that the contact is real.

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:27.140
Her brain is very exhausted.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:29.620
And of course...

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:35.800
The 20-day examination on the ship is still very insufficient for any final conclusions.

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:41.860
But anatomically, functionally, the difference between homo sapiens is limited by details.

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:45.620
Will you not look at the price?

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:49.120
And he forgave me. There will be no free lunch.

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:50.880
All my pockets are angry.

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:55.850
And besides, from a biological point of view, this is of no interest.

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:58.850
You understand perfectly well, Zagorsky cloned in the year 200.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.640
She is a conservator. She is from there.

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:03.260
And there is no water.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:07.080
Here you can read about our report at the Institute of Cosmic Biology.

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:12.300
We are dealing with the origin of alien mind.

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:16.940
The very principle of the behavior of human beings in vitro

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:19.180
carries a certain secret goal.

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:23.500
Our task is to get to the purpose of this experiment.

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:26.840
And until we determine the purpose of its creation,

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:29.420
we will treat this creature as a girl.

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:37.950
It is easy to treat it as a full-fledged human creation.

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:46.060
As long as its purpose is unknown, it remains a source of danger for humanity.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.580
What do you suggest?

00:08:50.140 --> 00:08:54.060
We isolate this creature in our Institute of Space Biorobotechnics.

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:58.590
All-rounders study it, first of all, the brain.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:06.240
And when we understand everything, we'll be able to talk about contacts.

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:09.510
I don't agree with Nadezhda Ivanova.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.740
Contact is a two-sided concept.

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:16.410
I don't argue with her, but you've forgotten about our responsibility.

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:22.470
No, I haven't. But I can't forget about the responsibility before her.

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:26.560
Nadezhda, Sergey, I don't understand the subject of your argument.

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:29.570
But it's obvious that it's not a robot, but a human.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:31.640
And she's a charming girl.

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:57.480
She's so scary.

00:09:58.540 --> 00:09:59.660
Poor thing.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.300
It's the robot's job.

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:11.610
I advise you to allow her to live in my house.

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:14.110
What if she is created to kill?

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:18.340
Any contact with the extraterrestrial mind presupposes a share of the risk.

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:23.040
One day you have to take this risk.

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:29.230
In your institute, she will be completely isolated. It's bad.

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:35.920
Let her stay among people. Let not only we understand her, but also she will understand us.

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:41.340
A person must have a home.

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:45.680
We need to prove that this is a person.

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:48.600
Let her become a person.

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:57.570
I repeat, I ask for advice to consider my proposal.

00:10:58.160 --> 00:10:59.820
I am competent enough to...

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:10.220
Okay, but how are you going to do the biocontrol in your house?

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:12.930
Couldn't you take it upon yourself?

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:16.480
Of course, but...

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:24.600
Everyone is free. I ask you to remain a member of the council of contacts.

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:04.900
I haven't forgotten anything, Mom. And you haven't changed at all. You still despise tenderness.

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:18.760
Come here. This is your house, and these are your relatives.

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:25.560
Hello. She's not used to it yet, and we look at her like at a hippopotamus.

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:42.270
A wonderful stranger can bite.

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:44.420
Stepa, don't be ashamed.

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:03.650
Father, she has never seen grass.

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:04.210
Maybe.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:08.580
Come here.

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:10.980
Don't be afraid.

00:13:58.580 --> 00:13:59.980
pizdez

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.480
The rain is terrible, and in China it's a disaster.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.260
What's wrong with that? We hardly see it.

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:25.930
Go back home.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:33.290
Stepka, I brought you a stone, a bracelet.

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:36.550
The only precious thing on the planet Scenic.

00:14:36.650 --> 00:14:38.010
Thank you.

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:39.300
This is the stone.

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:40.780
I don't need anything else.

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:53.680
You're such an egoist.

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:56.090
You haven't been here for more than a year and you're back.

00:14:56.640 --> 00:14:58.040
And I don't believe that you're back.

00:14:58.510 --> 00:14:59.970
Because all your thoughts...

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:04.260
If you are busy with this creature, it is more important to you than I am, and what I am here is more important to you than Stepan.

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:15.730
You are wrong, mom. I missed my home, you, Stepan, Matalya, everyone.

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:23.330
There is work.

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:35.520
It's my job, you see. Father brought me this shell from Java.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:39.410
This shell is yours. But you broke my heart.

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:41.460
What was I talking about?

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:43.040
About my job.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.810
No, I was talking about Stepan.

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:48.180
You've completely forgotten that you have a son.

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:53.460
You bring him stupid stones.

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:55.600
You see him once a year.

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:57.320
And he's of a broken age.

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:59.800
He should fly to space, but he's rude.

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:05.580
I've been away for a long time. You just didn't notice, grandma.

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:07.140
Well, I heard.

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:13.510
Yes, yes, yes. She will live here with Tanya.

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:18.790
In the evening, the technician will come and put a protective field on the window.

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:21.290
Well, Seryozha, you turn the house into a playground.

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:25.440
Forgive me, but I have to foresee some elementary things.

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:28.080
Are you afraid of her?

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:29.860
She can.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:35.570
She is very lonely. If we don't become close to her, she may die.

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:43.060
Well, Seryozha, as a result, you will go on another expedition and I will have to deal with everything myself.

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:48.970
Like when you brought this predator, well, this one, who always sneezed.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.420
How is he?

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:51.920
Ligocephalus Sonica.

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:54.640
And I treated the scars on Stepan's hands.

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:59.870
Mom, you are a doctor. Moreover, you are a carpenter. You have been dealing with children all your life.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:00.420
Human.

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:05.310
Here's Nadezhda.

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:05.770
Hello.

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:12.340
May I come in?

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:16.440
Hello, Maria Pavlovna.

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:18.740
I read your last article.

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:19.320
It's very interesting.

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:20.600
Thank you.

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:24.100
They complain about you.

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:26.900
Thank you.

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:27.660
It's very important to me.

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:33.270
Not all the time.

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:34.720
We have business to take care of.

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:36.440
Of course.

00:17:38.020 --> 00:17:38.260
Please.

00:17:38.560 --> 00:17:45.270
Where is she?

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:56.140
I wouldn't leave her in your place without inspection.

00:17:57.770 --> 00:17:58.550
Where are you going to keep her?

00:17:59.400 --> 00:17:59.980
I'll keep her...

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:05.150
She will live in Tanya's room until Tanya comes home.

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:07.860
On the stairs to the right.

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:09.440
Have you seen anything there?

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:13.460
Maria Pavlovna, in the council of contacts,

00:18:13.680 --> 00:18:16.260
I was instructed to provide biocontrol of this creature.

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:19.620
Believe me, I am not just interested.

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:22.770
Sergei.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:26.800
Nadezhda is right. We decided so at the council.

00:18:31.280 --> 00:18:34.460
Don't be mad at your mother. She was waiting for me, and here's this girl.

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:39.610
Then me? Is it really so hard to forgive what happened 20 years ago?

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:46.540
That wall is new.

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:47.950
I somehow guessed.

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:50.200
And I remember everything. Armored concrete?

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:56.060
No. Now it's plastic. We'll have to remove it.

00:18:57.020 --> 00:18:58.080
What do you mean, how to remove it?

00:18:58.890 --> 00:18:59.970
It will interfere with biocontrol.

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:02.170
Seryozha, you'll have to clean it.

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:04.210
Sergey, I'm protesting.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:09.720
Mom, you need to. You're a scientist yourself.

00:19:10.240 --> 00:19:11.580
No, I'm not a scientist now.

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:15.340
Now I'm the guardian of this house.

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:17.420
We'll replace it with another one in half an hour.

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:18.180
You won't even notice.

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:20.950
It's not about the time, it's not even about the walls.

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:24.220
The thing is, Nadezhda,

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:26.320
you've never had children.

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:28.280
What does that have to do with it?

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.400
How cruel it is to conquer me with this, especially you.

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:37.580
My life function is not related to motherhood.

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:43.300
In half an hour they will bring a new wall.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:44.000
Okay.

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:52.230
So in this house there is no more poverty with me.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:54.170
Then I'm leaving.

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:55.680
Glasha!

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:06.270
Mom, there's cheese in the garden.

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:07.690
I'm dressed for you.

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:11.160
How are you?

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:14.400
Everything's fine?

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:15.320
We're fine.

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:20.430
Hello.

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:29.700
I've met you.

00:20:30.570 --> 00:20:31.650
I know, I lied to you.

00:20:32.610 --> 00:20:33.910
Don't get out of the water for three days.

00:20:33.930 --> 00:20:35.550
Soon the gills will grow.

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:36.900
You lost weight.

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:38.010
I lost weight.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:38.710
You too.

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:43.220
I heard that a girl will live in our house.

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:43.930
Aha.

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:46.270
You too.

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:50.920
Once I desperately argued with Zagorsky.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:53.560
Do you remember such an adept at clowning?

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:56.270
Let's go, we'll show you what we can do.

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:03.380
Gleb, what do you think of this creature?

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:05.380
It's charming, Bjorn.

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:15.390
I don't know anything anymore.

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:20.690
Now say it.

00:21:20.890 --> 00:21:21.070
Me.

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:52.430
I'm going to take a shower

00:22:01.440 --> 00:22:03.470
Stop! Let's all rest in the air.

00:22:05.960 --> 00:22:25.660
What's the bill?

00:22:25.820 --> 00:22:27.020
A merciless eye.

00:22:27.200 --> 00:22:27.760
As always.

00:23:00.960 --> 00:23:01.160
You

00:24:22.364 --> 00:24:22.804
doing it.

00:24:30.030 --> 00:24:57.620
I said, you're going to court, go to court.

00:25:12.030 --> 00:25:12.870
Is it a person or someone else?

00:25:12.950 --> 00:25:24.930
Hey, guys, it's time for breakfast, and I'm in a hurry to go to the clinic.

00:25:25.010 --> 00:25:29.000
She's teleporting, she's doing it herself.

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:31.320
Who's going to catch her? She's not a butterfly.

00:25:31.660 --> 00:25:32.530
Come here.

00:25:37.500 --> 00:25:44.170
No, no, this is not my planet.

00:25:44.410 --> 00:25:54.760
I can't remember, I can't tell.

00:26:00.320 --> 00:26:04.020
You can do everything. You will remember everything.

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:34.220
It's strange, as if the whole memory is turned off on purpose.

00:26:34.220 --> 00:26:44.290
I remember, I remember the fourth and the brother.

00:26:50.840 --> 00:26:53.390
Butterfly, black-tailed, well, you're just a good boy.

00:26:54.630 --> 00:26:55.670
Butterfly, butterfly.

00:26:56.640 --> 00:26:58.760
Well, what's up?

00:27:00.030 --> 00:27:01.950
What did you learn from your father?

00:27:08.090 --> 00:27:13.660
She has a great reaction, but like you, things are fine in the cosmonaut institute.

00:27:14.260 --> 00:27:14.560
Excellent!

00:27:15.470 --> 00:27:17.950
If you don't count small troubles, a couple of stones.

00:27:18.340 --> 00:27:20.800
Some Selena called you.

00:27:20.840 --> 00:27:23.780
She flew to our practice.

00:27:24.310 --> 00:27:25.520
She demands a meeting.

00:27:25.820 --> 00:27:28.980
Who is she? And what is so strange about her?

00:27:31.880 --> 00:27:35.640
A hobby of youth. My parents work on the moon, so they called us.

00:27:36.000 --> 00:27:39.040
It's a pity that your youth is to blame.

00:27:40.020 --> 00:27:41.220
And don't say it!

00:27:42.630 --> 00:27:51.310
You'd better look at what I brought. A watermelon.

00:27:51.310 --> 00:27:55.720
The first one this year.

00:27:56.390 --> 00:27:56.950
Well, a watermelon.

00:28:00.800 --> 00:28:07.860
Watermelon? What is the passion of youth?

00:28:10.090 --> 00:28:11.670
She really has a great reaction.

00:28:12.570 --> 00:28:20.190
Why are you scaring her?

00:28:20.250 --> 00:28:23.940
This is the first watermelon this year.

00:28:42.830 --> 00:28:47.650
Okay, I don't feel sorry for the watermelon. Can you repeat it? Can you stop it?

00:28:47.970 --> 00:28:48.330
Like what?

00:28:50.670 --> 00:28:51.370
Why didn't you stop it?

00:28:52.870 --> 00:28:53.190
Why?

00:28:55.050 --> 00:28:56.200
Because I asked you to.

00:29:00.190 --> 00:29:02.220
I'm sorry, I upset you.

00:29:03.740 --> 00:29:05.960
I'm afraid she can't do such tricks on order.

00:29:06.300 --> 00:29:09.100
Oh, my God, you should go to Nadezhda.

00:29:10.020 --> 00:29:17.400
I won't go to her. She looks at me.

00:29:17.720 --> 00:29:20.470
She wants to understand you.

00:29:20.750 --> 00:29:28.070
Sir, take her.

00:32:00.120 --> 00:32:19.000
Who? Alenikh. Why? That's what you asked your granny. She knows everything.

00:32:30.060 --> 00:32:37.470
Our whole life is an experiment. Let's go.

00:32:37.750 --> 00:32:41.190
I don't want you to go there.

00:32:41.370 --> 00:32:45.460
What are you talking about? I grew up here. It's my nature.

00:32:46.020 --> 00:32:50.830
You can't live in water.

00:32:52.730 --> 00:32:59.070
Try it. Try it. It seems that water is dangerous.

00:33:42.220 --> 00:33:43.540
I'm just afraid of you.

00:34:37.360 --> 00:34:41.400
Hi! Have you seen Stepan?

00:34:41.920 --> 00:34:46.960
He's there.

00:34:49.260 --> 00:34:49.760
I'm Selena.

00:34:50.060 --> 00:34:51.980
And you're definitely a nerd.

00:34:52.540 --> 00:34:52.840
No.

00:34:53.100 --> 00:34:54.260
That's the right, beautiful name.

00:34:54.480 --> 00:34:58.720
K! Stepan! Get out!

00:35:01.600 --> 00:35:03.450
Why are you looking at me like that? Do you like me?

00:35:04.290 --> 00:35:05.490
Yes, I like many people.

00:35:05.830 --> 00:35:08.380
Do you know how to swim?

00:35:08.380 --> 00:35:08.760
No.

00:35:09.640 --> 00:35:10.970
Do you want to learn?

00:35:11.150 --> 00:35:11.490
No.

00:35:11.620 --> 00:35:12.620
Are you afraid?

00:35:13.460 --> 00:35:14.100
No, not at all.

00:35:14.640 --> 00:35:16.200
In life, you definitely need to try everything.

00:35:16.860 --> 00:35:18.080
I'm a test-taker by nature.

00:35:18.080 --> 00:35:18.810
I was on the moon.

00:35:19.130 --> 00:35:19.740
I went down in a boot.

00:35:20.440 --> 00:35:22.000
What is the passion of youth?

00:35:22.480 --> 00:35:25.630
Even so.

00:35:25.850 --> 00:35:28.760
Why are you asking about it?

00:35:30.000 --> 00:35:32.660
You said it was his passion of his youth.

00:35:33.660 --> 00:35:36.080
Nonsense! I didn't even pay attention to him.

00:35:36.760 --> 00:35:38.820
Did he say that to you?

00:35:39.440 --> 00:35:40.190
He said that to me.

00:35:42.360 --> 00:35:43.240
Indisputable fool!

00:35:45.730 --> 00:35:46.590
Why don't you wear a wig?

00:35:47.090 --> 00:35:48.680
It's too primitive.

00:35:49.080 --> 00:35:59.890
I love water, air, music and beautiful people.

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:01.660
I especially adore children.

00:36:01.960 --> 00:36:02.800
Do you love children?

00:36:04.070 --> 00:36:05.570
Oh, or you don't know them?

00:36:06.130 --> 00:36:06.690
I know.

00:36:06.970 --> 00:36:09.360
Oh, you're so sincere.

00:36:10.380 --> 00:36:13.070
I had sisters and brothers.

00:36:13.490 --> 00:36:14.970
And Birka?

00:36:14.990 --> 00:36:29.590
Your inferiority.

00:36:30.570 --> 00:36:32.740
It's certainly justified. I know your story.

00:36:33.390 --> 00:36:35.250
If you want, I can help you in many ways.

00:36:35.250 --> 00:36:43.890
Oh, not so decisively.

00:36:44.030 --> 00:36:44.250
What?

00:36:45.190 --> 00:36:51.300
It's not accepted. It's not done.

00:36:51.580 --> 00:36:53.530
I did it.

00:36:56.760 --> 00:36:57.460
Hello, Selina.

00:36:57.680 --> 00:36:57.880
Hi.

00:36:58.550 --> 00:36:59.680
What are you? It's not her.

00:37:00.960 --> 00:37:01.400
How's it going on the Moon?

00:37:02.410 --> 00:37:05.580
I'm going into the water, and it says you can't do that.

00:37:05.960 --> 00:37:11.320
There's nothing special about it, it's just not accepted.

00:37:11.980 --> 00:37:13.900
It's called the moral norms of the earthlings.

00:37:21.310 --> 00:37:22.290
Seryozha, aren't you busy?

00:37:23.240 --> 00:37:23.860
Do you have a business with me?

00:37:25.290 --> 00:37:26.130
Yes, turn on the screen.

00:37:27.310 --> 00:37:29.590
I've discovered something new, I can't help but share it with you.

00:37:31.980 --> 00:37:32.960
It's part of your concept.

00:37:33.580 --> 00:37:36.730
Seryozha, she's been living with you for two months.

00:37:36.730 --> 00:37:38.420
What can you tell the world?

00:37:39.930 --> 00:37:41.680
I'm happy with the way things are going.

00:37:43.850 --> 00:37:46.170
You actors have always been prone to optimism.

00:37:46.550 --> 00:37:51.450
For me, it's the creation of the mind.

00:37:51.730 --> 00:37:57.150
Come here. This is the control area.

00:37:59.480 --> 00:37:59.960
Explain...

00:38:00.730 --> 00:38:03.210
The one who created it wanted it to be an obedient machine.

00:38:03.590 --> 00:38:07.360
If it is affected by this area, it loses control over itself.

00:38:07.600 --> 00:38:09.200
Are you sure about that?

00:38:09.620 --> 00:38:12.620
Yes. I just need to choose the radiation parameters.

00:38:14.810 --> 00:38:16.820
Here, look, I'll put it on now.

00:38:40.620 --> 00:38:48.950
You can't do this anymore.

00:38:49.130 --> 00:38:50.300
I'm working, Sergey.

00:38:52.920 --> 00:38:53.700
I'll come to you now.

00:38:54.990 --> 00:38:56.050
I'll be glad to see you.

00:39:01.880 --> 00:39:02.600
Aren't you bored of me?

00:39:02.820 --> 00:39:04.420
Yes, of course.

00:39:05.600 --> 00:39:06.420
You're definitely in love.

00:39:07.380 --> 00:39:09.380
Nonsense. She lives in our house, I'm responsible for her.

00:39:10.450 --> 00:39:11.050
No, let's go.

00:39:21.940 --> 00:39:23.280
You'd be a good nanny.

00:39:23.340 --> 00:39:25.590
But the child is undoubtedly of a great age.

00:39:25.940 --> 00:39:27.180
Leave her alone, Selena.

00:39:27.640 --> 00:39:28.580
I won't come to her.

00:39:28.700 --> 00:39:29.960
But to keep her in my heart...

00:39:30.860 --> 00:39:33.230
I wouldn't let her near the children.

00:39:34.190 --> 00:39:36.320
She eats them.

00:39:36.910 --> 00:39:37.270
Selena.

00:39:37.610 --> 00:39:40.480
Did I hurt you?

00:39:41.120 --> 00:39:42.400
Don't pay attention. Let's go.

00:39:43.090 --> 00:39:44.350
I don't want her to be here.

00:39:44.470 --> 00:39:44.950
What's wrong with you?

00:40:03.610 --> 00:40:10.610
Stop. You have no right to put your hand on a person. It must be your first law.

00:40:14.000 --> 00:40:18.360
Again. I can't do it anymore.

00:40:53.000 --> 00:40:56.050
Every one of you has a center of obedience.

00:40:56.430 --> 00:40:59.900
I can always keep you from making mistakes.

00:41:00.960 --> 00:41:02.370
to warn you of trouble.

00:41:02.670 --> 00:41:04.620
This is your greatest good.

00:41:05.900 --> 00:41:09.150
But, like all good, it can turn into evil.

00:41:10.250 --> 00:41:11.770
This is what I was afraid of.

00:41:12.170 --> 00:41:16.380
I did it so that there was a connection between us.

00:41:16.440 --> 00:41:20.780
You will always know where I am.

00:41:21.240 --> 00:41:23.490
And I am where you are.

00:41:31.210 --> 00:41:31.330
Thank you.

00:42:05.310 --> 00:42:10.090
That's how power over a man was, and I used it with pleasure.

00:42:11.550 --> 00:42:25.240
I'm sorry, Seryozha, but I thought I was helping you and Nauka.

00:42:45.260 --> 00:42:51.970
Now I'm a robot for you. You can control me, so I'm a robot.

00:42:52.620 --> 00:42:54.520
Who will control you?

00:42:55.380 --> 00:42:57.570
Nadezhda. Or others.

00:42:58.320 --> 00:42:59.240
No, it's forbidden on Earth.

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:03.040
...experience with a human brain, but not with a robot brain.

00:43:03.900 --> 00:43:06.720
Raise your hand, press the pad,

00:43:06.980 --> 00:43:12.190
turn it, well done, on the way.

00:43:17.340 --> 00:43:20.240
...and I can be corrected, improved.

00:43:21.330 --> 00:43:23.450
No, you are a human in everything.

00:43:23.450 --> 00:43:29.860
And if you want, you will always be able to improve.

00:43:30.000 --> 00:43:36.510
This center is so connected to others that I won't be able to live without it.

00:43:36.510 --> 00:43:39.900
I'll turn on like a broken car.

00:43:40.380 --> 00:43:43.420
We are all cars in our own way.

00:43:43.420 --> 00:43:48.430
My father can also order me.

00:43:50.260 --> 00:43:51.120
You're talking about something else.

00:43:51.260 --> 00:43:56.200
You could be fascinated by robots.

00:44:00.000 --> 00:44:05.240
I have bad feelings for you.

00:44:05.390 --> 00:44:09.210
Who do you think you are, Stepan?

00:44:09.230 --> 00:44:09.690
I'm not a cheater.

00:44:09.970 --> 00:44:12.400
And you're no worse than the others.

00:44:12.830 --> 00:44:14.210
Everyone has his own shortcomings.

00:44:14.610 --> 00:44:17.710
One has no leg, the other has a sense of humor.

00:44:18.010 --> 00:44:19.550
And you have a center of dissension.

00:44:19.710 --> 00:44:25.340
You would have an amazing wife.

00:44:25.480 --> 00:44:28.440
You won't have a price.

00:44:32.460 --> 00:44:33.800
Everyone has his own shortcomings.

00:45:32.040 --> 00:45:47.660
All the way down?

00:45:48.090 --> 00:45:49.370
I'll do it. I'll definitely do it.

00:45:49.450 --> 00:45:50.980
And then you can be happy.

00:45:51.100 --> 00:45:52.500
I can't see the space like with my own eyes.

00:45:52.660 --> 00:45:53.630
I can do it.

00:45:53.850 --> 00:45:54.810
With my navigation.

00:46:04.160 --> 00:46:12.540
I have the last exam, and you?

00:46:13.540 --> 00:46:14.980
Latyra, you're soon, I'm late for the exam.

00:46:15.420 --> 00:46:25.580
I won't come for lunch today. I'm going home to your colleague Prul.

00:46:26.590 --> 00:46:29.810
Finally, I won't wait for the bright moment when he flies away.

00:46:30.000 --> 00:46:31.640
Is he a great scientist in the ocean?

00:46:31.960 --> 00:46:34.710
In his own way, in his own way.

00:46:35.410 --> 00:46:36.590
He's a peculiar scientist.

00:46:36.950 --> 00:46:39.780
But, actually, that's a completely different condition for the ocean.

00:46:40.390 --> 00:46:48.890
I'm going.

00:46:51.860 --> 00:46:58.860
Is today the last exam?

00:47:01.560 --> 00:47:01.980
Well, I'm going.

00:47:02.140 --> 00:47:06.630
It's hard to think that the universe is driving you all crazy.

00:47:08.230 --> 00:47:13.080
You shouldn't have taken off your wig.

00:47:13.580 --> 00:47:16.440
I haven't seen Tatyana for a year and a half.

00:47:17.970 --> 00:47:19.470
Sergei went to Pluton.

00:47:19.510 --> 00:47:21.480
You see, they found some weirdos.

00:47:21.680 --> 00:47:22.530
Stop it, Stepa.

00:47:23.270 --> 00:47:27.070
You, Stepa, will fly away from our exam to the hell of Kulnichka for practice.

00:47:27.390 --> 00:47:28.520
Yes, I will.

00:47:28.920 --> 00:47:29.840
Grandpa, listen to me.

00:47:30.540 --> 00:47:33.600
She's in the water all the time. And you have a future, don't you?

00:47:33.850 --> 00:47:35.030
I'll stay on Earth.

00:47:35.620 --> 00:47:36.520
Yes, yes, you will.

00:47:38.280 --> 00:47:39.580
She's an unreliable ally.

00:47:41.360 --> 00:47:45.790
If she makes a phone call now and they say,

00:47:45.810 --> 00:47:48.470
No, your planet has been found...

00:48:08.160 --> 00:48:15.290
I understand, I understand. That's right, that's right. But before my arrival, I ask you not to do anything else.

00:48:15.350 --> 00:48:19.670
There are pathological births on the plateau of the Southern Cross in the expedition. You need to go.

00:48:19.990 --> 00:48:28.450
I must be proud that my grandmother is asking for help.

00:48:30.830 --> 00:48:31.800
Nitya, do you want to go with me?

00:48:32.580 --> 00:48:32.980
Very much.

00:48:33.160 --> 00:48:37.480
I think we all forgot at home that I'm leaving the Earth tomorrow.

00:48:37.580 --> 00:48:41.700
And you will pass the exam, wait for us, and we will return home with her in the evening.

00:49:06.460 --> 00:49:06.720
Are you tired?

00:49:07.620 --> 00:49:09.830
No, my grandmother did everything.

00:49:10.760 --> 00:49:11.920
She performed a miracle.

00:49:12.360 --> 00:49:15.260
This is her work. What are you looking for here?

00:49:15.360 --> 00:49:17.140
The ancient city, the one that was before.

00:49:17.500 --> 00:49:17.680
Why?

00:49:20.960 --> 00:49:25.500
Our ancestors lived here. They created the beginning of civilization.

00:49:27.860 --> 00:49:29.160
If it weren't for them, we wouldn't exist.

00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:32.260
But they died a long time ago, and there's nothing left, only stones.

00:49:32.480 --> 00:49:33.440
Stones, too, they say.

00:49:33.540 --> 00:49:37.130
We must save the memory of those who died.

00:49:37.310 --> 00:49:40.060
Why save the dead?

00:49:40.440 --> 00:49:42.320
Everything is connected.

00:49:42.780 --> 00:49:48.730
We dug up this stone last year.

00:49:50.820 --> 00:49:53.460
The poet lived a thousand years ago,

00:49:53.860 --> 00:49:56.630
and he was tormented by the same thoughts as you and me.

00:49:56.770 --> 00:49:59.510
On Earth, we are not forever.

00:50:00.600 --> 00:50:05.090
Only for a while. Even nephrit is crushed. Even the feathers of the tsal are torn.

00:50:05.510 --> 00:50:08.640
We are not on Earth forever. Only for a while.

00:50:09.940 --> 00:50:10.580
Only for a while.

00:50:12.610 --> 00:50:15.190
And there was a sacrificial well.

00:50:15.450 --> 00:50:18.220
People were thrown there?

00:50:18.500 --> 00:50:23.300
Yes, young men and women. When it was studied, they found many women's decorations.

00:50:23.760 --> 00:50:24.320
Let's go and see.

00:50:25.460 --> 00:50:29.560
It was a very cruel world. The fate of a person was determined in it from birth.

00:50:31.150 --> 00:50:42.100
All-powerful priests sacrificed people to praise the gods, to call the rain, to bring victory in the war.

00:50:44.130 --> 00:50:45.210
It's very deep here.

00:51:00.220 --> 00:51:02.160
You are the last hope, Dessa.

00:51:02.360 --> 00:51:08.340
If you don't fulfill your purpose, our world is doomed to death.

00:51:08.620 --> 00:51:15.510
I feel the duty, I feel the loyalty to your goal.

00:51:15.690 --> 00:51:20.660
This is our fate. Forget about joy, forget about yourself,

00:51:20.680 --> 00:51:25.000
how I did it. I sacrifice you for the sake of Dessa.

00:51:26.970 --> 00:51:29.790
I am forced to deprive you.

00:51:30.090 --> 00:51:32.250
The right to ordinary happiness.

00:51:56.780 --> 00:51:58.140
Good evening.

00:52:00.160 --> 00:52:00.920
Come in. Sit down.

00:52:01.040 --> 00:52:01.840
Good evening.

00:52:03.780 --> 00:52:04.540
These are my friends.

00:52:04.740 --> 00:52:05.360
Nice to meet you.

00:52:05.860 --> 00:52:11.220
Today the mission visited the Crimean resorts and the Institute of Biology and the Sea.

00:52:11.320 --> 00:52:13.890
The words of the representatives of the planet Dessa.

00:52:14.090 --> 00:52:21.010
We arrived here using the help of the Galactic Intelligence Patrol.

00:52:21.430 --> 00:52:29.970
The main purpose of our visit, on behalf of the dying planet, is to ask for the experience of saving the planet.

00:52:30.160 --> 00:52:32.050
This planet is for you, earthlings.

00:52:32.170 --> 00:52:33.220
Who are they?

00:52:33.370 --> 00:52:34.430
We are grateful to you...

00:52:34.430 --> 00:52:35.190
What kind of mission is this?

00:52:35.230 --> 00:52:36.370
This planet is for Earthlings.

00:52:36.740 --> 00:52:37.240
Why are they here?

00:52:37.560 --> 00:52:41.240
Did something bother you?

00:52:41.380 --> 00:52:43.610
The phone didn't ring.

00:52:43.970 --> 00:52:47.860
We need to be at home immediately.

00:52:47.900 --> 00:52:51.770
But Professor Lebedev is sleeping. She is very tired.

00:52:52.150 --> 00:52:53.770
Then let him sleep. Send me alone.

00:52:56.420 --> 00:52:58.080
It's very difficult. We will try.

00:53:00.700 --> 00:53:10.910
Attention! Registration of tickets and passenger luggage for the 13 Sigma Q flight on the Earth-Moon-Yunon route is announced.

00:53:11.620 --> 00:53:14.480
Registration is carried out at section number 6.

00:53:17.190 --> 00:53:24.810
Attention! The arrival of the tourist flight 245 Tourist from Mars is delayed to 23 hours.

00:53:25.740 --> 00:53:27.920
Well, how are you? Very late, there will be troubles.

00:53:28.550 --> 00:53:29.510
Where are your things, cadet?

00:53:30.060 --> 00:53:30.680
I carry it with me.

00:53:31.790 --> 00:53:33.430
Take it with you and go to Astra.

00:53:33.640 --> 00:53:34.920
Remember? Astra.

00:53:34.960 --> 00:53:37.760
We only go to the stars, but through the walls.

00:53:40.570 --> 00:53:41.210
That's how it is.

00:53:42.030 --> 00:53:42.390
Marmalade!

00:53:43.280 --> 00:53:44.040
Well, what's the trouble?

00:53:44.560 --> 00:53:45.420
No, grandma, it's all right.

00:53:45.600 --> 00:53:46.540
I was transferred to another ship.

00:53:47.020 --> 00:53:47.620
Take care of yourself.

00:53:48.020 --> 00:53:48.680
Take care of yourself.

00:53:48.780 --> 00:53:50.540
Marmalade, where are you taking me?

00:53:51.160 --> 00:53:51.860
Come on, quickly.

00:53:52.000 --> 00:53:53.280
To the cargo gate.

00:53:53.790 --> 00:53:55.570
It's not a cargo gate, but a passenger.

00:53:56.160 --> 00:53:57.260
I'm an honorary passenger.

00:53:57.680 --> 00:53:59.480
And if I differ in number from you...

00:54:00.000 --> 00:54:02.600
This is not a reason to despise me.

00:54:02.600 --> 00:54:06.540
I confirm, I confirm, please be more careful.

00:54:06.920 --> 00:54:09.520
Academic Prull was on a scientific mission on Earth.

00:54:09.760 --> 00:54:10.630
This is my colleague.

00:54:10.930 --> 00:54:13.450
It's too late, the insult has been made.

00:54:13.870 --> 00:54:15.590
Don't be offended, Academic Prull.

00:54:15.810 --> 00:54:17.630
Shturman Kolotun will correct the mistake.

00:54:18.390 --> 00:54:19.950
Shturman, please keep an eye on him.

00:54:20.070 --> 00:54:21.830
Professor Klimov knows everything perfectly.

00:54:22.050 --> 00:54:22.710
He will warn you.

00:54:24.170 --> 00:54:27.320
Dear colleague, I wish you a happy journey.

00:54:27.600 --> 00:54:29.900
All cosmetographs are on your order.

00:54:32.970 --> 00:54:35.950
Your compatriots are eagerly awaiting your return.

00:54:36.330 --> 00:54:36.730
I'm off.

00:54:37.090 --> 00:54:37.620
I see.

00:54:38.390 --> 00:54:38.910
Cursant!

00:54:39.010 --> 00:54:39.110
Yes.

00:54:39.290 --> 00:54:39.990
Follow him.

00:54:40.250 --> 00:54:47.130
Have you been on this ship for a long time?

00:54:47.990 --> 00:54:49.630
Sixteen years, Cursant.

00:54:49.790 --> 00:54:50.670
Is this an intelligence ship?

00:54:51.070 --> 00:54:51.430
Yes.

00:54:51.590 --> 00:54:52.710
In the past.

00:54:53.010 --> 00:54:53.430
And now?

00:54:55.120 --> 00:54:56.160
Astro-Oscenizer.

00:54:58.840 --> 00:54:59.360
Oscenizer?

00:55:00.920 --> 00:55:01.400
Asinusator.

00:55:01.700 --> 00:55:07.780
Are you embarrassed by something, cadet?

00:55:08.000 --> 00:55:09.280
I thought you were from the long-distance reconnaissance.

00:55:09.460 --> 00:55:10.420
Ah, I see.

00:55:10.860 --> 00:55:14.580
You're disappointed. Don't be upset.

00:55:15.350 --> 00:55:16.910
We are the angels of space.

00:55:17.350 --> 00:55:20.300
Next time you won't be late for your ship.

00:55:21.060 --> 00:55:21.540
Let's go.

00:55:21.700 --> 00:55:26.600
Let's go.

00:55:30.510 --> 00:55:38.870
Attention! The landing on the ship Astra, which is flying in a special race on the route Earth-Ocean-Desse, is announced.

00:55:38.870 --> 00:55:40.790
The passenger is asked to go on board.

00:55:41.300 --> 00:55:42.400
Exit number 7.

00:56:07.130 --> 00:56:08.360
Thank you.

00:56:08.360 --> 00:56:14.690
Sergeant Lebedev, you will start your training with care.

00:56:14.990 --> 00:56:18.420
You will take care of your professor colleague Prulya

00:56:18.420 --> 00:56:20.430
until we bring Prulya home.

00:56:21.470 --> 00:56:22.520
Where will I live?

00:56:23.890 --> 00:56:25.940
Here, the bed is there.

00:56:26.340 --> 00:56:27.320
What should I do?

00:56:28.740 --> 00:56:29.970
Feed him, clean up.

00:56:30.380 --> 00:56:34.850
In short, colleague Prul will tell you.

00:56:34.990 --> 00:56:37.550
I'll tell you. First of all, turn on the heater.

00:56:37.870 --> 00:56:40.570
I'm freezing. Oh, these modern young people.

00:56:40.610 --> 00:56:44.570
They forget that care about me is beneficial. I've already caught a cold.

00:57:16.830 --> 00:57:20.450
I don't understand anything. It's time for prevention.

00:57:38.480 --> 00:57:40.680
Excuse me, this is Medaset.

00:57:40.760 --> 00:57:44.840
What are you doing here?

00:57:47.410 --> 00:57:49.130
I'm doing my internship here.

00:57:49.150 --> 00:57:50.240
Are you crazy?

00:57:52.820 --> 00:57:54.500
I've been working on this young man, too.

00:57:55.750 --> 00:57:56.630
Kursant Lebedev.

00:57:58.050 --> 00:57:59.370
Victor Klimov. Nice to meet you.

00:57:59.690 --> 00:57:59.890
When?

00:58:00.000 --> 00:58:01.990
I haven't been to your house for so long.

00:58:01.990 --> 00:58:04.530
I'm fine. Nia is healthy too.

00:58:05.440 --> 00:58:06.460
Yes, why do you need a doctor?

00:58:07.150 --> 00:58:08.650
I was instructed to take care of the octopus.

00:58:09.640 --> 00:58:10.940
And the colleague Prulik?

00:58:11.020 --> 00:58:12.690
He caught a cold. What to do?

00:58:12.930 --> 00:58:18.780
What symptoms?

00:58:20.070 --> 00:58:21.570
Symptoms? I don't even know how to measure his temperature.

00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:32.420
Block 32. I'll be in the second section.

00:58:32.720 --> 00:58:41.000
There is no collision. There is no reason to worry. Everything is within permissible limits.

00:58:42.720 --> 00:58:46.000
You are permitting limits. I ask you to examine me again after departure.

00:58:46.380 --> 00:58:49.010
We will certainly do it. Stepan, will you go with me?

00:58:49.110 --> 00:58:49.290
What?

00:58:49.990 --> 00:58:52.410
You are hiding something from me.

00:58:52.650 --> 00:58:56.440
Do not hide. The hardest truths are better than the unknown.

00:58:56.880 --> 00:58:58.740
I swear on your health.

00:59:00.000 --> 00:59:09.760
It's normal. The more you fuss, the more he will demand from you.

00:59:10.240 --> 00:59:11.950
But is he really healthy?

00:59:13.280 --> 00:59:16.890
Absolutely. But always be polite and patient with him.

00:59:16.930 --> 00:59:20.010
He is our guest, and he is lonely. Have you been dealing with aliens?

00:59:20.470 --> 00:59:21.450
I had to.

00:59:21.670 --> 00:59:23.710
Well, great. Well, good luck. The take-off is soon.

00:59:23.790 --> 00:59:29.830
Thank you. Excuse me, please tell me, some call us angels, others...

00:59:30.000 --> 00:59:33.230
I understand that this is all a joke, but...

00:59:33.540 --> 00:59:34.760
There is a lot of truth in this funny version.

00:59:35.820 --> 00:59:39.200
Our exact name is the Post-Ecological Expedition.

00:59:39.260 --> 00:59:41.250
We are the emergency help of the universe.

00:59:41.680 --> 00:59:42.060
How loud!

00:59:42.770 --> 00:59:47.540
Sorry, our ship is specially equipped to help those worlds that are in danger.

00:59:48.140 --> 00:59:53.760
Sometimes from natural disasters, more often because of the inhabitants themselves,

00:59:53.760 --> 00:59:59.760
we clean the smokey atmosphere, dirty rivers, polluted soil, reduce radiation levels.

01:00:00.540 --> 01:00:02.580
And now we are flying on a call to the planet of Dessa.

01:00:02.740 --> 01:00:05.480
There was a threatening situation, the planet is dying.

01:00:05.820 --> 01:00:11.070
So we are like angels, we fly to bring order, and work like oxygenators.

01:00:11.290 --> 01:00:13.630
You are being called by a troll.

01:00:14.430 --> 01:00:18.440
Take away, take away the prey.

01:00:18.700 --> 01:00:22.080
Vasiliy, how did you get here? Get out of here!

01:00:22.200 --> 01:00:26.120
I demand official apologies for the attack on the face of my family.

01:00:28.000 --> 01:00:29.040
Vasiliy does not eat reasonable.

01:00:30.600 --> 01:00:34.640
However, you're right. The one responsible for the mess will be punished.

01:00:34.980 --> 01:00:36.210
Why didn't you close the door?

01:00:36.480 --> 01:00:37.160
It was closed.

01:00:37.440 --> 01:00:40.910
How do I know that you have cats on the starboard?

01:00:43.000 --> 01:00:43.820
Kursant Lebedev!

01:00:44.670 --> 01:00:48.620
First of all, it's not a cat. It's a crew member.

01:00:49.000 --> 01:00:49.440
Vasily.

01:00:49.480 --> 01:00:52.020
And Strelchnaya.

01:00:55.010 --> 01:00:55.130
Vasya.

01:01:00.920 --> 01:01:03.510
Everyone get ready for the start.

01:01:03.670 --> 01:01:05.560
Take the starting chair.

01:01:06.520 --> 01:01:07.420
Count the time.

01:01:07.640 --> 01:01:09.460
Who is at the start?

01:01:10.700 --> 01:01:11.220
Stepan?

01:01:11.260 --> 01:01:12.730
You're making fun of me.

01:01:12.960 --> 01:01:19.820
You're a hermetic, Stepanko, a hermetic.

01:02:01.280 --> 01:02:05.200
We've passed the outer mollusks. Everything's fine.

01:02:05.520 --> 01:02:09.600
Give me a pelling on Ganymede.

01:02:11.650 --> 01:02:12.150
Got it.

01:02:14.480 --> 01:02:16.820
How's the comet Spira? We won't cut its tail.

01:02:19.460 --> 01:02:20.820
We've got meteorite protection.

01:02:21.320 --> 01:02:22.240
Are you serious?

01:02:22.900 --> 01:02:24.400
No, nothing serious.

01:02:24.930 --> 01:02:25.770
Well, have a good trip.

01:02:26.050 --> 01:02:26.470
Thank you.

01:02:33.420 --> 01:02:35.980
Attention to passengers and crew members.

01:02:37.220 --> 01:02:41.120
Astro spacecraft has left the solar system.

01:02:43.120 --> 01:02:45.500
Overloads are over. You can leave the launch chairs.

01:02:45.840 --> 01:02:46.080
Hello.

01:02:49.390 --> 01:02:51.840
My name is Nia.

01:02:52.060 --> 01:02:54.520
Nice to meet you.

01:02:54.560 --> 01:02:55.140
I'm Edik.

01:02:55.650 --> 01:02:56.130
Edik.

01:02:58.620 --> 01:02:59.780
I've secretly been on your ship.

01:03:00.190 --> 01:03:01.470
Hello. I figured it out.

01:03:01.710 --> 01:03:04.860
But I can't imagine how he managed to do it, and I don't know why.

01:03:05.160 --> 01:03:06.320
I need to get to the desk.

01:03:07.520 --> 01:03:10.300
Strange wish. But why did you do it secretly?

01:03:10.620 --> 01:03:13.080
I found out about it before the ship took off.

01:03:13.380 --> 01:03:23.330
What happened before the ship took off?

01:03:23.390 --> 01:03:25.620
I found out that I was with the desk.

01:03:25.800 --> 01:03:29.020
Professor Ivanov can tell you everything about me.

01:03:34.510 --> 01:03:36.920
Professor Ivanova, please go up to the command room.

01:03:37.220 --> 01:03:40.560
I was found in space a year ago in a destroyed spaceship.

01:03:43.110 --> 01:03:44.170
Hello, Nadezhda.

01:03:44.290 --> 01:03:46.230
I'm listening, Oleg.

01:03:46.330 --> 01:03:50.230
Do you know them?

01:03:50.370 --> 01:03:57.170
There are such coincidences.

01:03:57.230 --> 01:03:59.860
You know that...

01:04:00.030 --> 01:04:01.580
I know.

01:04:01.820 --> 01:04:03.540
Is it our new cadet?

01:04:03.740 --> 01:04:05.850
It's her brother.

01:04:06.470 --> 01:04:09.280
So it's he who helped you to get on the ship.

01:04:09.400 --> 01:04:09.820
Shall I call him?

01:04:09.960 --> 01:04:13.030
No, he doesn't know anything.

01:04:13.290 --> 01:04:14.600
Then why are you here?

01:04:19.840 --> 01:04:20.900
I was born here.

01:04:24.610 --> 01:04:26.580
Who's with him?

01:04:32.080 --> 01:04:32.560
Did you remember?

01:04:33.530 --> 01:04:35.030
No, I found out about it by accident.

01:04:35.130 --> 01:04:36.300
I saw the message.

01:04:36.560 --> 01:04:38.250
What did they tell you?

01:04:38.840 --> 01:04:39.120
Nothing.

01:04:39.600 --> 01:04:41.520
Did it open to them?

01:04:41.950 --> 01:04:42.170
No.

01:04:42.250 --> 01:04:53.750
You can become a toy in the hands of evil forces.

01:04:54.740 --> 01:04:54.940
Why?

01:04:58.130 --> 01:04:59.510
Because I'm artificial.

01:05:00.860 --> 01:05:15.100
I don't know what they did to me. I'll try not to be a threat to you.

01:05:16.180 --> 01:05:17.580
You can't take responsibility for yourself.

01:05:19.450 --> 01:05:20.230
Maybe I should.

01:05:22.980 --> 01:05:23.740
Come to my cabin.

01:05:31.530 --> 01:05:34.640
I didn't understand anything. Tell me more about everything.

01:06:59.720 --> 01:06:59.960
I hope you enjoyed this video, and I'll see you in the next one.

01:07:00.190 --> 01:07:08.150
I like to dive into the depths of the ocean, and there I don't regret it, I don't regret it.

01:07:08.170 --> 01:07:16.300
At night I like to climb to the surface of the ocean,

01:07:16.640 --> 01:07:23.140
look at the stars and think about the many inhabited worlds.

01:07:24.440 --> 01:07:25.290
Let me try.

01:07:31.210 --> 01:07:41.490
And one more thing, I've missed the right time.

01:07:43.970 --> 01:07:46.230
Don't open it, there's a predator.

01:07:50.210 --> 01:07:57.090
Don't knock, I warned you.

01:07:57.250 --> 01:07:59.480
Look, he's stolen the chewing gum.

01:08:02.010 --> 01:08:02.190
Why?

01:08:02.330 --> 01:08:21.930
I'm a planet. Something must happen.

01:08:30.510 --> 01:08:32.190
Go to the course of an unknown space object.

01:08:32.470 --> 01:08:41.320
A ship.

01:08:41.500 --> 01:08:45.070
Give us our reconnaissance and ask for an answer.

01:08:45.310 --> 01:08:53.880
They're silent. Maybe a fragment of the station?

01:09:03.360 --> 01:09:05.680
They are not silent anymore.

01:09:05.720 --> 01:09:08.780
Look for him in the Somov Atlas.

01:09:08.780 --> 01:09:09.180
Found.

01:09:20.330 --> 01:09:21.030
Found and examined.

01:09:21.250 --> 01:09:22.770
April 2, 221.

01:09:23.290 --> 01:09:24.350
Star flight Pushkin.

01:09:24.390 --> 01:09:25.310
Died as a result of the explosion.

01:09:25.650 --> 01:09:26.130
Passport unknown.

01:09:26.610 --> 01:09:29.730
From the board is removed one live, artificially produced humanoid creature.

01:09:30.440 --> 01:09:31.660
The data is being processed.

01:09:37.820 --> 01:09:40.840
Professor Ivanov, Nia, representatives of the planet Odessa.

01:09:41.540 --> 01:09:43.360
I'm sorry, but I have to interrupt your sleep.

01:09:43.480 --> 01:09:45.680
I have to go to the command room.

01:10:03.250 --> 01:10:12.650
Do you know this ship?

01:10:12.830 --> 01:10:13.070
Yes.

01:10:16.700 --> 01:10:20.480
Excuse me for disturbing you.

01:10:20.600 --> 01:10:23.370
Do you know this ship?

01:10:31.560 --> 01:10:35.710
This is Gaia, the last device that left our planet.

01:10:35.990 --> 01:10:38.310
Fate has caught up with Glan.

01:10:38.510 --> 01:10:39.440
Who is Glan?

01:10:40.450 --> 01:10:45.750
Glan is my father. I need to get there.

01:10:45.910 --> 01:10:48.910
You need to be there if there are any materials left.

01:10:48.910 --> 01:10:52.550
Nia, I can't fulfill your request.

01:10:52.790 --> 01:10:56.030
The ship is dead, and there is no point in that.

01:10:57.080 --> 01:10:58.740
There is a point in everything.

01:11:07.030 --> 01:11:08.980
She teleported. She's on the ship.

01:11:18.900 --> 01:11:21.260
She died on the ship. There's a vacuum.

01:11:21.520 --> 01:11:22.800
What are we going to do?

01:11:23.170 --> 01:11:23.850
Let him out.

01:11:25.660 --> 01:11:28.660
Prevost, watch out for the exit. Get ready for the docking.

01:12:05.790 --> 01:12:06.070
Thank you.
